{
  "name": "CRYPTO 02 — Wallet Balance Monitor (BNB/BSC)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": { "interval": [{ "field": "hours", "hoursInterval": 1 }] }
      },
      "id": "sched",
      "name": "Cek Tiap Jam",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "a1", "name": "wallets", "value": "=[\n  { \"nama\": \"Farm 01\", \"alamat\": \"GANTI_WALLET_FARM\" },\n  { \"nama\": \"Burner TermiX\", \"alamat\": \"GANTI_WALLET_BURNER\" }\n]", "type": "array" },
            { "id": "a2", "name": "rpc", "value": "https://bsc.publicnode.com/", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cfg",
      "name": "Daftar Wallet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [460, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const out = [];\nfor (const w of $json.wallets) {\n  out.push({ json: { nama: w.nama, alamat: w.alamat, rpc: $json.rpc } });\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "split",
      "name": "Pecah Per Wallet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [680, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.rpc }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"method\": \"eth_getBalance\",\n  \"params\": [\"{{ $json.alamat }}\", \"latest\"]\n}",
        "options": { "timeout": 20000 }
      },
      "id": "rpc-call",
      "name": "Cek Saldo On-Chain",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [900, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Hex -> BNB -> USD (estimasi pakai harga BNB)\nconst hex = $json.result || '0x0';\nconst wei = BigInt(hex);\nconst bnb = Number(wei) / 1e18;\nconst hargaBnb = 730; // ganti kalau mau akurat — bisa fetch dari API\nconst usd = bnb * hargaBnb;\n\nconst nama = $('Pecah Per Wallet').item.json.nama;\nconst alamat = $('Pecah Per Wallet').item.json.alamat;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    nama,\n    alamat,\n    bnb: bnb.toFixed(8),\n    usd: usd.toFixed(2),\n    pesan: '💼 *SALDO WALLET*\\n\\n' + nama + '\\n' + alamat.slice(0,10) + '...' + alamat.slice(-6) + '\\n\\nSaldo: ' + bnb.toFixed(8) + ' BNB\\nEstimasi: $' + usd.toFixed(2) + '\\n\\nWaktu: ' + new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "fmt",
      "name": "Format Saldo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1120, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "GANTI_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "={{ $json.pesan }}",
        "additionalFields": { "parse_mode": "Markdown" }
      },
      "id": "send",
      "name": "Kirim Laporan Saldo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1340, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": { "id": "GANTI_CREDENTIAL_ID", "name": "Telegram Bot" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CRYPTO 02 — Wallet Balance Monitor\n\n**Alur:**\nTiap jam → cek saldo semua wallet di daftar → kirim laporan Telegram\n\n**Yang diedit:**\n- `wallets` di node *Daftar Wallet* — tambah wallet lo\n- `hargaBnb` di node *Format Saldo* — atau sambungkan ke API harga\n\n**Butuh:**\n- Telegram bot token + chat ID\n- Tidak butuh private key — cuma baca saldo publik\n\n**Upgrade:**\nTambah node *eth_call* untuk cek saldo token ERC-20 (bukan cuma BNB).\n\n**Cocok buat:**\n- Airdrop farmer (pantau banyak wallet)\n- Trader (pantau wallet utama)\n- Siapa pun yang mau kabar kalau saldo berubah",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note",
      "name": "Panduan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [160, 100]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Cek Tiap Jam": { "main": [[{ "node": "Daftar Wallet", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Daftar Wallet": { "main": [[{ "node": "Pecah Per Wallet", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Pecah Per Wallet": { "main": [[{ "node": "Cek Saldo On-Chain", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Cek Saldo On-Chain": { "main": [[{ "node": "Format Saldo", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Format Saldo": { "main": [[{ "node": "Kirim Laporan Saldo", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "staticData": null,
  "pinData": {}
}
